model_answer_en:
FDs: student_id → student_name; course_code → course_title; {student_id, course_code} → grade. The key of the flat table is {student_id, course_code}. student_name is partially dependent on student_id and course_title on course_code (2NF violations). Splitting removes the redundancy:

CREATE TABLE student (
    student_id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
    student_name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE course (
    course_code  VARCHAR(10) PRIMARY KEY,
    course_title VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE enrollment (
    student_id  INTEGER REFERENCES student(student_id),
    course_code VARCHAR(10) REFERENCES course(course_code),
    grade       CHAR(2),
    PRIMARY KEY (student_id, course_code)
);

Now student_name and course_title are each stored once (no update anomaly), a course can exist before any enrolment (no insertion anomaly), and deleting an enrolment does not erase the student or course (no deletion anomaly). Each table is in 3NF/BCNF: the only determinant in each is its own primary key. The decomposition is lossless (enrollment references the keys of student and course) and dependency-preserving (every FD lives inside one table).

model_answer_bn:
FD: student_id → student_name; course_code → course_title; {student_id, course_code} → grade। flat table-এর key {student_id, course_code}। student_name, student_id-এর উপর ও course_title, course_code-এর উপর partially dependent (2NF লঙ্ঘন)। ভাগ করলে redundancy দূর হয়:

CREATE TABLE student (
    student_id   INTEGER PRIMARY KEY,
    student_name VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE course (
    course_code  VARCHAR(10) PRIMARY KEY,
    course_title VARCHAR(100) NOT NULL
);

CREATE TABLE enrollment (
    student_id  INTEGER REFERENCES student(student_id),
    course_code VARCHAR(10) REFERENCES course(course_code),
    grade       CHAR(2),
    PRIMARY KEY (student_id, course_code)
);

এখন student_name ও course_title একবার করে থাকে (update anomaly নেই), enrolment-এর আগেই course থাকতে পারে (insertion anomaly নেই), ও enrolment মুছলে student বা course হারায় না (deletion anomaly নেই)। প্রতিটি table 3NF/BCNF-এ: প্রতিটিতে একমাত্র determinant তার নিজের primary key। decomposition lossless (enrollment, student ও course-এর key নির্দেশ করে) ও dependency-preserving (প্রতিটি FD এক table-এ)।
